{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#セトグッジョブログ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も開いてくださり、ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は日が短くなった！涼しくなった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの暑い夏が遠くに感じて、\nちょっとだけ寂しくなったりしているので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここからは、\n少しだけ夏を振り返ってもいいですか、、！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近のブログを見返してみたらね\n夏！夏！夏！夏！！！☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏のお話ばかりしている気がしますけど、、\n仕方がない！夏楽しいんだもん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当はブログの題名に「夏」の文字を入れたいのですよ？\nけどね今回は我慢しときました(^_^)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いろんな夏をね\n皆さんにも届けたくなっちゃうの！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日、皆さんと共有したいひと夏はこちら⬇️✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob8XeMrZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "随分と遡ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「週刊少年チャンピオン」34号の\n表紙に初登場させていただいたときの✨🍉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影日は天気もすごく良くて、夏らしい空気感だったり、見ているだけで夏を感じられるような写真がたくさんでした🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob7mBgFA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、夏は楽しみましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お祭りとか花火とか！\n夏にしかできないことできたかなーーー？🎐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob2TdF2n.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobOYipEk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は、地方公演のツアーの話をあげますね👐🏻\nまた#セトグッジョブログ開いてくれたら嬉しいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして明日は、オンラインミート＆グリート✨\n楽しみにしてますっ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "服を夏っぽくするか、秋っぽくするか迷う時期！\n何着よっかな〜〜〜！！！(^_^)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も1日お疲れさまです🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねっ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}